tion askScopeKey() { return current ? `dpr.askScope.${current.topic}/${current.name}` : 'dpr.askScope'; }\nfunction askScopeMode() {\n  try { return localStorage.getItem(askScopeKey()) === 'topic' ? 'topic' : 'paper'; } catch (e) { return 'paper'; }\n}\nfunction setAskScopeMode(mode) {\n  try { localStorage.setItem(askScopeKey(), mode); } catch (e) { /* 忽略 */ }\n  const sel = $('ask-scope'); if (sel) sel.value = mode;\n  syncThemeControls();\n}\n$('scope-chip').onclick = () => setAskScopeMode(askScopeMode() === 'topic' ? 'paper' : 'topic');\n$('ask-scope').onchange = () => setAskScopeMode($('ask-scope').value);\n\n// 路径复制：与「复制 LaTeX」共用同一个 copyText（剪贴板写入只有一处实现，见文件末尾定义）\n$('pdf-path').onclick = async () => {\n  const p = $('pdf-path').textContent;\n  if (!p) return;\n  toast((await copyText(p)) ? '路径已复制' : '复制失败，路径见状态文字悬停提示');\n};\n// 路径收进状态文字：点击「name · N 页」即复制（pdf-path 已 tucked，title 带完整路径）\n$('status').style.cursor = 'pointer';\n$('status').onclick = () => $('pdf-path').click();\n\nlet current = null;        // { topic, name }\nlet currentHasTranscript = null; // null=元信息未回；false=未转录（顶栏显示手动「转录」入口）\nlet zhState = { zh: false, dual: false, busy: false };\nlet statusMeta = ''; // openPaper 的「name · N 页」基线，翻译阶段标签褪去后恢复它\nlet zhVariant = null;      // null=原文 'dual'=中英对照 'zh'=纯中文（**分屏 split 也是 null**，见 C17）\n// 视图模式：四个控件（中/对照/分屏）挂在同一个状态上，互斥（§4.3）。\n// 'split'（模式 B）刻意让 zhVariant 保持 null —— 这样 eqHotEnabled()/公式面板文案/fitMode\n// 等既有分支继续按「原文」工作，零改动。\nlet viewMode = 'orig';     // 'orig' | 'zh' | 'dual' | 'split'\n// 每篇论文记住上次用的语言版本：伴读会话的跳转链接原地跳页不重载，\n// 加上这里的恢复，「中文界面跳中文」在同篇跳转/重开/跨论文三条路径上都成立\nconst variantKey = (topic, name) => `dpr.variant.${topic}/${name}`;\n\n// 阅读模式：scroll=连续滚动（默认，原行为）paged=单页翻页；每读者记忆\nlet pageMode = localStorage.getItem('dpr.pageMode') === 'paged' ? 'paged' : 'scroll';\n// 当前页：paged 是唯一渲染依据；scroll 由 IntersectionObserver 跟随回写（模式切换/跳页共享）\nlet curPage = 1;\n\n/* ================= 打开文献 ================= */\nfunction pdfUrl(variant) {\n  const q = `topic=${encodeURIComponent(current.topic)}&name=${encodeURIComponent(current.name)}`;\n  // 不带 t=Date.now()：/api/pdf 已有 ETag（文件 mtime+size），浏览器会 304 复用；\n  // 重新翻译后 ETag 自动变化，不会拿到旧译文。\n  return `/paper-reader/api/pdf?${q}${variant ? '&variant=' + variant : ''}`;\n}\n\nfunction syncTranscribeButton() {\n  const btn = $('transcribe-open');\n  if (currentHasTranscript === null) btn.disabled = false; // 换论文时清掉上篇在飞请求的禁用态\n  btn.style.display = current && currentHasTranscript === false && !openingPaper ? '' : 'none';\n  if (!openingPaper && !btn.disabled) btn.textContent = '转录';\n}\n\nasync function openPaper(topic, name, opts = {}) {\n  if (!name) return;\n  openingPaper = true;\n  currentHasTranscript = null;\n  syncTranscribeButton();\n  current = { topic, name };\n  // R-01/N-01：换文献的在飞译文必须**立刻**失效——必须放在本函数第一处 await 之前。\n  // 原来它在三次 await（`/api/paper`、`refreshZhState`、`loadFormulas`）之后，落在那几个窗口里\n  // 到达的旧响应仍会点亮气泡（t8 复审 N-01：P-A3 实测 seq 2→3 时气泡已显示上一篇译文）。\n  invalidateTranslate();\n  await resetViewCache();\n  teardownSplit();\n  // 换论文：旧文档先释放（新论文可能直接进入译文视图，不会经过 loadPdf）\n  renderToken++;\n  const oldPaperDoc = pdfDoc;\n  pdfDoc = null;\n  if (oldPaperDoc) await destroyPdfDoc(oldPaperDoc);\n  $('pdf-pages').innerHTML = '';\n  localStorage.setItem('dpr.last', JSON.stringify(current));\n  curPage = opts.page || 1; // 换论文从第一页（或跳转目标页）开始；变体切换/重译不走这里，页码保持\n  $('status').textContent = '加载 PDF…';\n  const q = `topic=${encodeURIComponent(topic)}&name=${encodeURIComponent(name)}`;\n  const meta = await api('/paper?' + q);\n  currentHasTranscript = Boolean(meta.hasTranscript);\n  statusMeta = meta.hasTranscript\n    ? `${name} · ${meta.pageCount ?? '?'} 页`\n    : `${name} · 未转录（提问时会自动转录）`;\n  $('status').textContent = statusMeta;\n  // 文件路径：不再占顶栏一行——挂在 #status 的 title（悬停可见）+ 点击 #status 复制；\n  // #pdf-path 按钮 tucked 隐藏，textContent 仍作为路径的唯一载体（复制逻辑读它）\n  const pathBtn = $('pdf-path');\n  pathBtn.textContent = meta.pdfPath || '';\n  pathBtn.style.display = meta.pdfPath ? '' : 'none';\n  $('status').title = meta.pdfPath ? `${meta.pdfPath}（点击复制）` : '';\n  setAskScopeMode(askScopeMode());\n  await refreshZhState();\n  // 恢复该论文上次的视图模式（持久化复用同一个键，取值域扩到 'split'；见 §4.3）\n  const saved = localStorage.getItem(variantKey(topic, name));\n  viewMode = viewModeFromSaved(saved, zhState);\n  if (saved && viewMode === 'orig') localStorage.setItem(variantKey(topic, name), ''); // 非空但不可用 → 回写空（防脏值）\n  zhVariant = viewMode === 'zh' ? 'zh' : viewMode === 'dual' ? 'dual' : null; // split → null\n  $('zh-toggle').classList.toggle('active', zhVariant !== null);\n  // 译文版页宽与原文不同（对照双栏≈2×），分屏每列只有一半宽 ⇒ 都先进适宽\n  if (zhVariant || viewMode === 'split') { fitMode = true; fitBtn.classList.add('active'); }\n  // 笔记与公式索引都必须在首次 paintPage 之前到货：paintPage 直接按 notes.list 铺波浪线。\n  // 两者互不依赖，并行拉取；笔记读失败不阻塞 PDF（loadNotes 内部吞错并保留空列表）。\n  const notesReady = loadNotes().catch(() => { /* 读失败：本页只是没有波浪线，不影响读论文 */ });\n  // 公式索引（MinerU content_list）：**必须在 loadPdf 之前到货**——热区是在 paintPage 里\n  // 按 eqIndex 铺的，先渲染会漏画/残留上一篇的矩形；又必须排在 zhVariant 定稿之后——\n  // eqHotEnabled()/renderEqPanel() 都按 zhVariant 决定「译文视图关热区」。失败不影响打开文献。\n  await loadFormulas();\n  updateDlBtn();\n  updateViewButtons();\n  if (viewMode === 'split') {\n    await notesReady; // 分屏两列由 openSplit 安排渲染，这里只需保证笔记在首帧前就绪\n    await openSplit(); // 内部自己拉原文 + -zh.pdf 两个文档\n  } else {\n    // R-02：原地换文献时**无条件**退掉分屏（幂等）——否则新论文有 -zh.pdf、而持久化视图又不是\n    // split 时，refreshZhState 的回落守卫不触发，中文列会留着**上一篇**的 PDF（pdfDocZh 也不释放）。\n    teardownSplit();\n    await notesReady;\n    const savedVariant = zhVariant;\n    if (savedVariant) {\n      // 直接打开上次的语言版本：只加载这一份，不再先渲染原文再切（打开时间不翻倍）。\n      // 原文文档在后台只加载、不渲染；第一次切回原文再画页（之后有缓存）。\n      let ok = false;\n      try { ok = await activateView(savedVariant); } catch { ok = false; }\n      if (!ok) {\n        await applyViewMode('orig');\n        await loadPdf(pdfUrl(null), { beforePaint: notesReady });\n        toast('打开译文失败，已退回原文', 5000);\n      } else {\n        $('zh-toggle').classList.toggle('active', zhVariant !== null);\n        updateViewButtons();\n        void loadViewDoc('orig').catch(() => { /* 后台预取原文，失败不影响当前视图 */ });\n      }\n    } else {\n      // 首帧渲染原文；空闲时预渲染译文，点「中」时直接换节点\n      await loadPdf(pdfUrl(null), { beforePaint: notesReady });\n      activeKey = 'orig';\n      schedulePreload();\n    }\n  }\n  if (opts.page) jumpTo(opts.page, opts.q); // 不 await：跳转内部自带「等页面渲出来」轮询\n  openingPaper = false;\n  syncTranscribeButton();\n  schedulePreload();\n}\n\n/* ================= 下载/导出 ================= */\n// 下载当前正在看的那个版本（原文/纯中文/中英对照）——导出译文的主要入口\nfunction updateDlBtn() {\n  const btn = $('dl-btn');\n  const findBtn = $('find-open');\n  const noteBtn = $('note-open');\n  if (!current) {\n    btn.style.display = 'none';\n    if (findBtn) findBtn.style.display = 'none';\n    if (noteBtn) noteBtn.style.display = 'none';\n    return;\n  }\n  btn.style.display = '';\n  if (findBtn) findBtn.style.display = '';\n  if (noteBtn) noteBtn.style.display = '';\n  btn.title = zhVariant === 'zh' ? '下载：纯中文版 PDF'\n    : zhVariant === 'dual' ? '下载：中英对照版 PDF' : '下载：原文 PDF';\n}\nfunction downloadCurrent() {\n  if (!current) return;\n  // 同源请求自动带 cookie（鉴权围栏）；download 属性空值 → 文件名取 content-disposition\n  const a = document.createElement('a');\n  a.href = pdfUrl(zhVariant) + '&download=1';\n  a.download = '';\n  document.body.appendChild(a);\n  a.click();\n  a.remove();\n}\n$('dl-btn').onclick = downloadCurrent;\n\n/* ================= 在文中查找（顶栏 🔍 / Ctrl+F）=================\n   索引来自 pdf.js 的 getTextContent 而**不是** DOM：翻页/分屏模式 DOM 里只有当前页，\n   只查 DOM 会漏掉其它页的命中。归一化口径与 highlightSnippet 一致（忽略空白、连字符、\n   软连字符与大小写），论文跨行断词（dis-tributed）也能命中。\n   页内高亮不给 span 加背景类（span 常常是一整行，加类还会动 textLayer 的换行与划词），\n   改用 Range.getClientRects() 在 .findLayer 里画百分比盒子：精确到词、缩放后自动对齐、\n   不吃鼠标事件（pointer-events:none，划词提问照旧）。 */\nconst FIND_MAX_HITS = 2000;   // 防御：极端查询（单个字母）不至于把面板撑爆\nconst FIND_WIN_KEY = 'dpr.findWin';       // 结果窗口的位置与尺寸（localStorage）\nconst FIND_EXPAND_KEY = 'dpr.findExpand'; // 精简/全部（1 = 全部）\nconst FIND_COMPACT_HITS = 30; // 精简模式列多少处\nconst findInputEl = $('find-input');\nconst findCountEl = $('find-count');\nlet find = { q: '', needle: '', hits: [], idx: -1, index: null, doc: null, building: false, shown: false, listStale: true, expand: false };\nlet findTimer = null;\nlet findWin = { x: null, y: null, w: 330, h: 340 };  // x/y 为 null = 还没定位过（贴 🔍 下方）\nconst findWinEl = $('find-window');\ntry { find.expand = localStorage.getItem(FIND_EXPAND_KEY) === '1'; } catch { /* 隐私模式：默认精简 */ }\n\n/** 归一化 + 回原串索引：丢掉空白/连字符/软连字符并转小写（map[i] = 归一化串第 i 字符在原文的位置） */\nfunction findNorm(str) {\n  let nh = '';\n  const map = [];\n  for (let i = 0; i < str.length; i++) {\n    const c = str[i].toLowerCase();\n    if (/\\s/.test(c) || c === '-' || c === '­') continue;\n    nh += c;\n    map.push(i);\n  }\n  return { nh, map };\n}\n\n/** 一页的文本索引：text 保留空格（给结果列表做上下文片段），nh/map 用于匹配 */\nasync function findPageIndex(n) {\n  const page = await pdfDoc.getPage(n);\n  const tc = await page.getTextContent();\n  // item 之间补空格：pdf.js 把同一行的单词切成多个 item，直接拼会粘连成 \"theenclave\"\n  const text = tc.items.map((it) => it.str || '').join(' ').replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').trim();\n  const { nh, map } = findNorm(text);\n  return { text, nh, map };\n}\n\nasync function findBuildIndex() {\n  if (!pdfDoc) return;\n  if (find.index && find.doc === pdfDoc) return;\n  const doc = pdfDoc;\n  find.doc = doc;\n  find.index = new Map();\n  find.building = true;\n  const total = doc.numPages;\n  for (let n = 1; n <= total; n++) {\n    if (find.doc !== doc) return;   // 索引期间换了文档/变体：这份索引作废\n    try { find.index.set(n, await findPageIndex(n)); } catch { find.index.set(n, null); }\n    updateFindCount(`索引 ${n}/${total}`);\n    if (n % 8 === 0) await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 0));   // 让出主线程，别卡住滚动\n  }\n  find.building = false;\n}\n\n/** 上下文片段：命中前后各留一段，去掉首尾空白并把偏移跟着挪 */\nfunction findSnippet(text, start, end) {\n  const pad = 42;\n  let a = Math.max(0, start - pad);\n  let b = Math.min(text.length, end + pad);\n  while (a < start && /\\s/.test(text[a])) a++;\n  while (b > end && /\\s/.test(text[b - 1])) b--;\n  return { pre: a > 0, post: b < text.length, text: text.slice(a, b), hitStart: start - a, hitEnd: end - a };\n}\n\n/** 扫全篇收集命中（按页、按出现顺序），每处带「该页内第几个」序号（高亮时要对号入座） */\nfunction findCollect() {\n  find.hits = [];\n  find.idx = -1;\n  const needle = find.needle;\n  if (!needle || !find.index) return;\n  for (const [page, e] of find.index) {\n    if (!e || !e.nh) continue;\n    let from = 0;\n    let ord = 0;\n    for (;;) {\n      if (find.hits.length >= FIND_MAX_HITS) return;\n      const at = e.nh.indexOf(needle, from);\n      if (at < 0) break;\n      const start = e.map[at];\n      const end = e.map[at + needle.length - 1] + 1;\n      find.hits.push({ page, ord, snippet: findSnippet(e.text, start, end) });\n      ord += 1;\n      from = at + Math.max(1, needle.length);\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nfunction updateFindCount(note) {\n  if (!findCountEl) return;\n  findCountEl.classList.remove('hit');\n  if (note) { findCountEl.textContent = note; findCountEl.title = ''; return; }\n  if (!find.q || !find.needle) { findCountEl.textContent = ''; findCountEl.title = ''; return; }\n  if (find.building) { findCountEl.textContent = '索引…'; return; }\n  if (!find.hits.length) {\n    findCountEl.textContent = '无匹配';\n    findCountEl.title = '没有找到这段文字。扫描件没有文本层时也搜不到';\n    return;\n  }\n  // idx < 0 = 还没跳过（边打边搜阶段）：显示总处数，别让用户看到 \"0/12\"\n  findCountEl.textContent = find.idx < 0 ? `${find.hits.length} 处` : `${find.idx + 1}/${find.hits.length}`;\n  findCountEl.classList.add('hit');\n  findCountEl.title = `共 ${find.hits.length} 处（Enter 下一处，Shift+Enter 上一处）`;\n}\n\nfunction findMetaText() {\n  if (!find.q) return '输入关键词：Enter 跳到第一处，Shift+Enter 上一处，Esc 关闭。';\n  if (!find.needle) return '';\n  if (find.building && !find.hits.length) return '正在建立索引…';\n  if (!find.hits.length) {\n    return `没有找到「${find.q}」。如果这篇是扫描件（没有文本层）就会搜不到，可先用转录或 MinerU 解析再试。`;\n  }\n  const pages = new Set(find.hits.map((h) => h.page)).size;\n  const capped = find.hits.length >= FIND_MAX_HITS ? `（已截断到前 ${FIND_MAX_HITS} 处）` : '';\n  return `「${find.q}」共 ${find.hits.length} 处，分布在 ${pages} 页${capped}。点条目直接跳转。`;\n}\n\n/* ---------- 结果窗口：可拖动、可拖边框缩放、可精简/全部 ---------- */\nfunction findWinSave() {\n  if (!findWinEl) return;\n  try {\n    const r = findWinEl.getBoundingClientRect();\n    localStorage.setItem(FIND_WIN_KEY, JSON.stringify({\n      x: Math.round(r.left), y: Math.round(r.top), w: Math.round(r.width), h: Math.round(r.height),\n    }));\n  } catch { /* 隐私模式记不住：下次回到默认位置，不影响本次使用 */ }\n}\n\nfunction findWinLoad() {\n  if (!findWinEl) return;\n  try {\n    const raw = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(FIND_WIN_KEY) || 'null');\n    if (raw) {\n      if (Number.isFinite(raw.w)) findWin.w = Math.max(240, Math.min(720, raw.w));\n      if (Number.isFinite(raw.h)) findWin.h = Math.max(190, raw.h);\n      if (Number.isFinite(raw.x) && Number.isFinite(raw.y)) { findWin.x = raw.x; findWin.y = raw.y; }\n    }\n  } catch { /* 坏 JSON：用默认值 */ }\n}\n\n/** 落位并夹在视口内（窗口拖动/缩放/视口变化后都走这里，保证不会拖到屏幕外找不回来） */\nfunction findWinPlace() {\n  if (!findWinEl) return;\n  const w = findWin.w;\n  const h = Math.min(findWin.h, Math.max(190, window.innerHeight - 40));\n  let x = findWin.x;\n  let y = findWin.y;\n  if (x === null || y === null) {\n    // 首次打开：贴在 🔍 按钮下方（用户点的那颗按钮旁边最符合直觉）；按钮没显出来就贴右上角\n    const btn = $('find-open');\n    const r = btn ? btn.getBoundingClientRect() : null;\n    if (r && r.width) {\n      x = r.right - w;\n      y = r.bottom + 6;\n    } else {\n      x = window.innerWidth - w - 26;\n      y = 64;\n    }\n  }\n  x = Math.max(8, Math.min(x, window.innerWidth - w - 8));\n  y = Math.max(8, Math.min(y, window.innerHeight - h - 8));\n  findWinEl.style.width = w + 'px';\n  findWinEl.style.height = h + 'px';\n  findWinEl.style.left = Math.round(x) + 'px';\n  findWinEl.style.top = Math.round(y) + 'px';\n  findWin.x = Math.round(x);\n  findWin.y = Math.round(y);\n}\n\nfunction findWinShow(on) {\n  if (!findWinEl) return;\n  if (!on) {\n    findWinEl.classList.remove('on');\n    find.shown = false;\n    return;\n  }\n  findWinEl.classList.add('on');\n  find.shown = true;\n  findWinPlace();\n  renderFindList();\n}\n\n/** 精简模式只列当前命中附近的一段，避免几百处命中把窗口刷成冗长清单 */\nfunction findVisibleIdx() {\n  const n = find.hits.length;\n  const out = [];\n  if (find.expand || n <= FIND_COMPACT_HITS) {\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) out.push(i);\n    return out;\n  }\n  const center = find.idx < 0 ? 0 : find.idx;\n  let start = Math.max(0, center - Math.floor(FIND_COMPACT_HITS / 2));\n  if (start + FIND_COMPACT_HITS > n) start = Math.max(0, n - FIND_COMPACT_HITS);\n  for (let i = start; i < start + FIND_COMPACT_HITS; i++) out.push(i);\n  return out;\n}\n\nfunction findSetExpand(on) {\n  find.expand = on;\n  try { localStorage.setItem(FIND_EXPAND_KEY, on ? '1' : '0'); } catch { /* 忽略 */ }\n  find.listStale = true;\n  renderFindList();\n}\n\n/** 重建结果列表（只在查询/模式变化时做；跳转只切 .cur 类，不重建 DOM） */\nfunction renderFindList() {\n  const list = $('find-list');\n  const meta = $('find-meta');\n  const head = $('find-headcount');\n  if (!list || !meta || !head) return;\n  meta.textContent = findMetaText();\n  head.textContent = !find.q || !find.needle ? ''\n    : !find.hits.length ? '无匹配'\n    : find.idx < 0 ? `${find.hits.length} 处` : `${find.idx + 1}/${find.hits.length}`;\n  const expBtn = $('find-expand');\n  if (expBtn) {\n    expBtn.style.display = find.hits.length > FIND_COMPACT_HITS ? '' : 'none';\n    // 按钮写的是「点了会变成什么」：精简时显示「全部」，全部时显示「精简」\n    expBtn.textContent = find.expand ? '精简' : '全部';\n    expBtn.classList.toggle('on', find.expand);\n    expBtn.title = find.expand ? `当前列出全部 ${find.hits.length} 处，点击收成精简` : `当前只列 ${FIND_COMPACT_HITS} 处，点击展开全部 ${find.hits.length} 处`;\n  }\n  if (!find.listStale && list.childElementCount) { syncFindCurrent(); return; }\n  find.listStale = false;\n  list.innerHTML = '';\n  if (!find.hits.length) return;\n  const frag = document.createDocumentFragment();\n  const shown = findVisibleIdx();\n  let lastPage = 0;\n  for (const i of shown) {\n    const hit = find.hits[i];\n    if (hit.page !== lastPage) {\n      const ph = document.createElement('div');\n      ph.className = 'find-page';\n      ph.textContent = `第 ${hit.page} 页`;\n      frag.appendChild(ph);\n      lastPage = hit.page;\n    }\n    const s = hit.snippet;\n    const btn = document.createElement('button');\n    btn.type = 'button';\n    btn.className = 'find-item';\n    btn.dataset.i = String(i);\n    if (s.pre) btn.appendChild(document.createTextNode('…'));\n    btn.appendChild(document.createTextNode(s.text.slice(0, s.hitStart)));\n    const mk = document.createElement('mark');\n    mk.textContent = s.text.slice(s.hitStart, s.hitEnd);\n    btn.appendChild(mk);\n    btn.appendChild(document.createTextNode(s.text.slice(s.hitEnd)));\n    if (s.post) btn.appendChild(document.createTextNode('…'));\n    btn.addEventListener('click', () => { void findGoto(i); });\n    frag.appendChild(btn);\n  }\n  if (shown.length < find.hits.length) {\n    const more = document.createElement('button');\n    more.type = 'button';\n    more.className = 'find-item';\n    more.style.textAlign = 'center';\n    more.style.color = 'var(--text-2)';\n    more.textContent = `还有 ${find.hits.length - shown.length} 处没有列出 · 点这里展开全部`;\n    more.addEventListener('click', () => findSetExpand(true));\n    frag.appendChild(more);\n  }\n  list.appendChild(frag);\n  syncFindCurrent();\n}\n\nfunction syncFindCurrent() {\n  const list = $('find-list');\n  if (!list) return;\n  let cur = null;\n  list.querySelectorAll('.find-item').forEach((el) => {\n    const on = Number(el.dataset.i) === find.idx;\n    el.classList.toggle('cur', on);\n    if (on) cur = el;\n  });\n  if (cur) cur.scrollIntoView({ block: 'nearest' });\n}\n\nfunction findClearBoxes() {\n  document.querySelectorAll('.findLayer').forEach((l) => l.remove());\n  document.querySelectorAll('.textLayer span.find-hit').forEach((sp) => sp.classList.remove('find-hit', 'cur'));\n}\n\n/** 一页 DOM 的「拼接串 + 归一化映射 + 偏移→(文本节点, offset) 定位器」 */\nfunction findPageHay(pageDiv) {\n  const tl = pageDiv.querySelector('.textLayer');\n  if (!tl) return null;\n  // 用**文本节点**而不是 span：Range.setStart(node, n) 里的 n 对元素节点是「子节点序号」，\n  // 对文本节点才是字符偏移。之前把字符偏移直接喂给 span，Range 要么抛错、要么落在行首，\n  // getClientRects 拿不到有效矩形 → 这就是「搜到了却没有标黄」的根因。\n  const nodes = [];\n  const startOf = [];\n  let hay = '';\n  const walker = document.createTreeWalker(tl, NodeFilter.SHOW_TEXT);\n  for (let n = walker.nextNode(); n; n = walker.nextNode()) {\n    const t = n.nodeValue || '';\n    if (!t) continue;\n    nodes.push(n);\n    startOf.push(hay.length);\n    hay += t;\n  }\n  if (!hay) return null;\n  const { nh, map } = findNorm(hay);\n  if (!nh) return null;\n  const at = (off) => {\n    let lo = 0;\n    let hi = startOf.length - 1;\n    let idx = 0;\n    while (lo <= hi) {\n      const mid = (lo + hi) >> 1;\n      if (startOf[mid] <= off) { idx = mid; lo = mid + 1; } else { hi = mid - 1; }\n    }\n    return [nodes[idx], Math.min(off - startOf[idx], nodes[idx].nodeValue.length)];\n  };\n  return { nh, map, at };\n}\n\n/** 兜底高亮：Range 几何算不出来（跨节点怪例、TextLayer 结构变化）时给 span 加类。\n *  宁可粗一点，也不能出现「搜到了却看不见」。 */\nfunction findMarkSpansFallback(tl, ord) {\n  const spans = [...tl.querySelectorAll('span:not(.markedContent)')];\n  let seen = 0;\n  for (const sp of spans) {\n    const t = sp.textContent || '';\n    const { nh } = findNorm(t);\n    if (!nh || !nh.includes(find.needle)) continue;\n    sp.classList.add('find-hit');\n    if (seen === ord) sp.classList.add('cur');\n    seen += 1;\n  }\n  return seen > 0;\n}\n\n/** 在指定页画出该页全部命中（第 ord 处标为当前），返回当前盒子供滚动 */\nfunction findMarkPage(page, ord) {\n  findClearBoxes();\n  const div = origPageNode(page);\n  const tl = div && div.querySelector('.textLayer');\n  if (!div || !tl || !find.needle) return null;\n  const hay = findPageHay(div);\n  if (!hay) return null;\n  const rect = tl.getBoundingClientRect();\n  if (!rect.width || !rect.height) return null;\n  const layer = document.createElement('div');\n  layer.className = 'findLayer';\n  // 必须插在 textLayer **之前**：paintPage 靠 div.firstChild/lastChild 取 canvas/textLayer，\n  // 追加在后面会让 lastChild 变成高亮层 → TextLayer 挂错容器（同 paintEqLayer 的坑）\n  div.insertBefore(layer, tl);\n  const percent = (v, base) => (v / base * 100).toFixed(3) + '%';\n  let cur = null;\n  let found = 0;\n  let from = 0;\n  for (;;) {\n    const at = hay.nh.indexOf(find.needle, from);\n    if (at < 0) break;\n    const start = hay.map[at];\n    const end = hay.map[at + find.needle.length - 1] + 1;\n    const [nodeA, offA] = hay.at(start);\n    const [nodeB, offB] = hay.at(end);\n    try {\n      const rng = document.createRange();\n      rng.setStart(nodeA, offA);\n      rng.setEnd(nodeB, offB);\n      for (const r of rng.getClientRects()) {\n        if (r.width < 0.6 || r.height < 0.6) continue;   // 换行点产生的退化矩形跳过\n        const isCur = found === ord;\n        const box = document.createElement('span');\n        box.className = 'find-box' + (isCur ? ' cur' : '');\n        box.style.left = percent(r.left - rect.left, rect.width);\n        box.style.top = percent(r.top - rect.top, rect.height);\n        box.style.width = percent(r.width, rect.width);\n        box.style.height = percent(r.height, rect.height);\n        layer.appendChild(box);\n        if (isCur && !cur) cur = box;\n      }\n    } catch { /* 这一处几何算不出来：循环结束后统一兜底 */ }\n    found += 1;\n    from = at + Math.max(1, find.needle.length);\n    if (found > 600) break;   // 单页防御\n  }\n  if (!layer.childElementCount) {\n    layer.remove();                     // 空层留着也没用\n    findMarkSpansFallback(tl, ord);     // 兜底：给命中的 span 上底色\n    return null;\n  }\n  return cur;\n}\n\n/** 等目标页真的出现（翻页/分屏模式要先切页再等 TextLayer 铺好） */\nasync function findReadyPage(page) {\n  if (!pdfDoc) return;\n  const p = Math.max(1, Math.min(page, pdfDoc.numPages));\n  if (lazyView) await ensureLazyPage(p); // 懒渲染：先把目标页真画出来，再等 textLayer\n  if ((pageMode === 'paged' || viewMode === 'split') && curPage !== p) {\n    curPage = p;\n    await rerender();\n    updatePager();\n  }\n  for (let i = 0; i < 120; i++) {\n    const div = origPageNode(p);\n    if (div && div.querySelector('.textLayer span')) return;\n    await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r, 50));\n  }\n}\n\nasync function findGoto(i) {\n  if (!find.hits.length) return;\n  const n = find.hits.length;\n  find.idx = ((i % n) + n) % n;          // 首尾循环\n  const hit = find.hits[find.idx];\n  await findReadyPage(hit.page);\n  if (!find.hits.length) return;\n  const cur = findMarkPage(hit.page, hit.ord);\n  updateFindCount();\n  if (!find.listStale) syncFindCurrent();\n  const target = cur || origPageNode(hit.page);\n  if (target) {\n    await new Promise((r) => requestAnimationFrame(r));\n    target.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });\n  }\n}\n\n/** 新的查询：清空命中 → 建索引（有缓存则秒回）→ 收集 → 渲染列表 */\nasync function findRun(q) {\n  find.q = q;\n  find.needle = findNorm(q).nh;\n  find.hits = [];\n  find.idx = -1;\n  find.listStale = true;\n  findClearBoxes();\n  renderFindList();\n  if (!find.needle) { updateFindCount(); return; }\n  updateFindCount('索引…');\n  await findBuildIndex();\n  if (find.q !== q) return;              // 期间输入又变了\n  findCollect();\n  renderFindList();\n  updateFindCount();\n  // 输入框就在窗口里，所以窗口一打开就一直开着；有结果时顺手把列表滚到当前命中\n  findWinShow(true);\n}\n\n/** 打开查找窗口（focus=true 时选中输入框内容，方便直接改写关键词） */\nfunction findPanelOpen(focus) {\n  if (!findWinEl) return;\n  findWinShow(true);\n  if (find.idx >= 0) findReapply();   // 重新打开时把上次的当前命中重新标出来，不用再跳一次\n  if (focus) { findInputEl.focus(); findInputEl.select(); }\n}\n\n/** 关闭查找窗口：连页内高亮一起收掉（关键词留着，下次按 🔍 还能直接用） */\nfunction findClose() {\n  findWinShow(false);\n  findClearBoxes();\n}\n\n/** 拖动窗口标题栏（指针事件：鼠标/触控板/触屏同一套） */\nfunction findWinDrag(e) {\n  if (e.button !== 0 || e.target.closest('button')) return;  // 头部按钮不触发拖动\n  e.preventDefault();\n  const start = { mx: e.clientX, my: e.clientY, x: findWinEl.offsetLeft, y: findWinEl.offsetTop };\n  const move = (ev) => {\n    findWin.x = start.x + (ev.clientX - start.mx);\n    findWin.y = start.y + (ev.clientY - start.my);\n    findWinPlace();\n  };\n  const up = () => {\n    window.removeEventListener('pointermove', move);\n    window.removeEventListener('pointerup', up);\n    window.removeEventListener('pointercancel', up);\n    findWinSave();\n  };\n  window.addEventListener('pointermove', move);\n  window.addEventListener('pointerup', up);\n  window.addEventListener('pointercancel', up);\n}\n\n/** 拖边缘/右下角改大小：dir = 'se'（角）| 'e'（右边缘）| 's'（下边缘） */\nfunction findWinResize(e, dir) {\n  if (e.button !== 0) return;\n  e.preventDefault();\n  e.stopPropagation();\n  const start = { mx: e.clientX, my: e.clientY, w: findWinEl.offsetWidth, h: findWinEl.offsetHeight, x: findWinEl.offsetLeft, y: findWinEl.offsetTop };\n  const move = (ev) => {\n    if (dir !== 's') findWin.w = Math.max(220, Math.min(window.innerWidth - 16, start.w + (ev.clientX - start.mx)));\n    if (dir !== 'e') findWin.h = Math.max(150, Math.min(window.innerHeight - 24, start.h + (ev.clientY - start.my)));\n    findWin.x = start.x;\n    findWin.y = start.y;\n    findWinPlace();\n  };\n  const up = () => {\n    window.removeEventListener('pointermove', move);\n    window.removeEventListener('pointerup', up);\n    window.removeEventListener('pointercancel', up);\n    findWinSave();\n  };\n  window.addEventListener('pointermove', move);\n  window.addEventListener('pointerup', up);\n  window.addEventListener('pointercancel', up);\n}\n\n/** 缩放/换模式/开关分屏后 DOM 被重建：把当前命中重新画上去 */\nfunction findReapply() {\n  if (!find.shown || !find.hits.length) return;\n  const hit = find.hits[find.idx];\n  if (hit) findMarkPage(hit.page, hit.ord);\n}\n\n/** 换了文档（换论文/原文↔译文）：索引与命中全部作废，输入框里的词留着 */\nfunction findReset() {\n  find.index = null;\n  find.doc = null;\n  find.hits = [];\n  find.idx = -1;\n  find.needle = '';\n  find.q = '';\n  find.listStale = true;\n  findClearBoxes();\n  updateFindCount();\n  renderFindList();\n}\n\nfindInputEl.addEventListener('input', () => {\n  clearTimeout(findTimer);\n  const q = findInputEl.value.trim();\n  // 边打边算（220ms 防抖）但不自动跳页：跳页留给 Enter/上下箭头，避免打字时页面乱跳\n  findTimer = setTimeout(() => { void findRun(q); }, 220);\n});\nfindInputEl.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n  if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    clearTimeout(findTimer);\n    const q = findInputEl.value.trim();\n    if (q !== find.q) { void findRun(q).then(() => findGoto(0)); return; }\n    void findGoto(find.idx + (e.shiftKey ? -1 : 1));\n  } else if (e.key === 'Escape') {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    findClose();\n  }\n});\n// 🔍 只是「打开查找窗口」：窗口关着就开、开着就把焦点给输入框（关键词和结果都还在）\n$('find-open').onclick = () => {\n  if (!pdfDoc) return;\n  findPanelOpen(true);\n};\n$('find-prev').onclick = () => { void findGoto(find.idx - 1); };\n$('find-next').onclick = () => { void findGoto(find.idx + 1); };\n$('find-window-close').onclick = findClose;\n$('find-expand').onclick = () => findSetExpand(!find.expand);\n$('find-head').addEventListener('pointerdown', findWinDrag);\n$('find-grip').addEventListener('pointerdown', (e) => findWinResize(e, 'se'));\n$('find-grip-r').addEventListener('pointerdown', (e) => findWinResize(e, 'e'));\n$('find-grip-b').addEventListener('pointerdown', (e) => findWinResize(e, 's'));\ndocument.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n  if ((e.metaKey || e.ctrlKey) && !e.altKey && (e.key === 'f' || e.key === 'F') && pdfDoc) {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    findPanelOpen(true);\n  }\n});\nwindow.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n  if (findWinEl.classList.contains('on')) findWinPlace();   // 视口变小：把窗口夹回可见范围\n});\nfindWinLoad();\n\n/** 排查用：控制台执行 dprFindDebug() 能看到当前查找的内部状态（高亮不显示时先看 boxes 是否为 0） */\nwindow.dprFindDebug = () => {\n  const cur = find.hits[find.idx];\n  return {\n    q: find.q,\n    needle: find.needle,\n    hits: find.hits.length,\n    idx: find.idx,\n    indexPages: find.index ? find.index.size : 0,\n    currentHit: cur ? { page: cur.page, ord: cur.ord } : null,\n    spansInDom: document.querySelectorAll('.textLayer span').length,\n    boxes: document.querySelectorAll('.find-box').length,\n    fallbackMarks: document.querySelectorAll('.textLayer span.find-hit').length,\n    windowOpen: !!(findWinEl && findWinEl.classList.contains('on')),\n    winPos: findWinEl ? { x: findWinEl.offsetLeft, y: findWinEl.offsetTop, w: findWinEl.offsetWidth, h: findWinEl.offsetHeight } : null,\n  };\n};\n\n/* ================= 笔记（划词标注 + 可移动笔记窗口）=================\n   存储：服务端 `<论文>.notes.json`（与 `.study.json` 同目录 ⇒ 跟文献走、换浏览器不丢、将来也能被伴读读到）。\n   锚点：页号 + 「该页 DOM 文本层拼接串」里的字符区间。文本层的内容只由 PDF 决定（与缩放/模式无关），\n        所以偏移在重渲染后仍然有效 → 每次渲染完成按偏移重建 Range → 百分比盒子（蓝色波浪线）。\n   为什么不用给 span 加 text-decoration：一个选区常跨多个 span，加类会把整行都画上波浪线。\n   盒子层 pointer-events:none，悬停/点击靠坐标命中测试 —— 绝不挡住划词选字。 */\nconst NOTE_WIN_KEY = 'dpr.noteWin';\nconst NOTE_BODY_MAX = 20000;\nconst notes = { list: [], shown: false, editing: null, isNew: true, armed: false, loading: false };\nlet noteWin = { x: null, y: null, w: 330, h: 360 };\nconst noteWinEl = $('note-window');\nconst noteTipEl = $('note-tip');\nlet noteArmTimer = 0;\nlet noteHoverRaf = 0;\nlet noteHoverId = null;\n\n/* ---------- 窗口几何：与查找窗同一套（位置尺寸记在 localStorage） ---------- */\nfunction noteWinSave() {\n  try {\n    const r = noteWinEl.getBoundingClientRect();\n    localStorage.setItem(NOTE_WIN_KEY, JSON.stringify({\n      x: Math.round(r.left), y: Math.round(r.top), w: Math.round(r.width), h: Math.round(r.height),\n    }));\n  } catch { /* 隐私模式记不住：下次回到默认位置 */ }\n}\nfunction noteWinLoad() {\n  if (!noteWinEl) return;\n  try {\n    const raw = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(NOTE_WIN_KEY) || 'null');\n    if (raw) {\n      if (Number.isFinite(raw.w)) noteWin.w = Math.max(260, Math.min(720, raw.w));\n      if (Number.isFinite(raw.h)) noteWin.h = Math.max(200, raw.h);\n      if (Number.isFinite(raw.x) && Number.isFinite(raw.y)) { noteWin.x = raw.x; noteWin.y = raw.y; }\n    }\n  } catch { /* 坏 JSON：用默认值 */ }\n}\nfunction noteWinPlace() {\n  if (!noteWinEl) return;\n  const w = noteWin.w;\n  const h = Math.min(noteWin.h, Math.max(200, window.innerHeight - 40));\n  let x = noteWin.x;\n  let y = noteWin.y;\n  if (x === null || y === null) {\n    const btn = $('note-open');\n    const r = btn ? btn.getBoundingClientRect() : null;\n    if (r && r.width) { x = r.right - w; y = r.bottom + 6; }\n    else { x = window.innerWidth - w - 26; y = 64; }\n  }\n  x = Math.max(8, Math.min(x, window.innerWidth - w - 8));\n  y = Math.max(8, Math.min(y, window.innerHeight - h - 8));\n  noteWinEl.style.width = w + 'px';\n  noteWinEl.style.height = h + 'px';\n  noteWinEl.style.left = Math.round(x) + 'px';\n  noteWinEl.style.top = Math.round(y) + 'px';\n  noteWin.x = Math.round(x);\n  noteWin.y = Math.round(y);\n}\nfunction noteWinDrag(e) {\n  if (e.button !== 0 || e.target.closest('button')) return;\n  e.preventDefault();\n  const start = { mx: e.clientX, my: e.clientY, x: noteWinEl.offsetLeft, y: noteWinEl.offsetTop };\n  const move = (ev) => {\n    noteWin.x = start.x + (ev.clientX - start.mx);\n    noteWin.y = start.y + (ev.clientY - start.my);\n    noteWinPlace();\n  };\n  const up = () => {\n    window.removeEventListener('pointermove', move);\n    window.removeEventListener('pointerup', up);\n    window.removeEventListener('pointercancel', up);\n    noteWinSave();\n  };\n  window.addEventListener('pointermove', move);\n  window.addEventListener('pointerup', up);\n  window.addEventListener('pointercancel', up);\n}\n/** 拖边缘/右下角改大小：dir = 'se'（角）| 'e'（右边缘）| 's'（下边缘） */\nfunction noteWinResize(e, dir) {\n  if (e.button !== 0) return;\n  e.preventDefault();\n  e.stopPropagation();\n  const start = { mx: e.clientX, my: e.clientY, w: noteWinEl.offsetWidth, h: noteWinEl.offsetHeight, x: noteWinEl.offsetLeft, y: noteWinEl.offsetTop };\n  const move = (ev) => {\n    if (dir !== 's') noteWin.w = Math.max(260, Math.min(window.innerWidth - 16, start.w + (ev.clientX - start.mx)));\n    if (dir !== 'e') noteWin.h = Math.max(200, Math.min(window.innerHeight - 24, start.h + (ev.clientY - start.my)));\n    noteWin.x = start.x;\n    noteWin.y = start.y;\n    noteWinPlace();\n  };\n  const up = () => {\n    window.removeEventListener('pointermove', move);\n    window.removeEventListener('pointerup', up);\n    window.removeEventListener('pointercancel', up);\n    noteWinSave();\n  };\n  window.addEventListener('pointermove', move);\n  window.addEventListener('pointerup', up);\n  window.addEventListener('pointercancel', up);\n}\n\n/* ---------- 读写（服务端 <论文>.notes.json） ---------- */\nfunction notesQs() {\n  return '?topic=' + encodeURIComponent(current.topic) + '&name=' + encodeURIComponent(current.name);\n}\nasync function loadNotes() {\n  notes.list = [];\n  notes.editing = null;\n  notes.loading = true;\n  if (noteWinEl) noteWinEl.classList.remove('editing');\n  noteClearLayers();\n  renderNoteList();\n  if (!current) { notes.loading = false; return; }\n  const want = current.topic + '/' + current.name;\n  try {\n    const r = await api('/notes' + notesQs());\n    if (!current || current.topic + '/' + current.name !== want) return;   // 期间换了文献：丢弃\n    notes.list = Array.isArray(r.notes) ? r.notes : [];\n  } catch { /* 笔记读不出来不影响读论文 */ }\n  notes.loading = false;\n  renderNoteList();\n  notesReapply();\n}\n/** 写一条（save）或删一条（delete）；服务端返回整份笔记列表，客户端整体替换 */\nasync function notesPost(action, note) {\n  const body = { topic: current.topic, name: current.name, action };\n  if (action === 'delete') body.id = note.id;\n  else body.note = note;\n  const r = await api('/notes', {\n    method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(body),\n  });\n  notes.list = Array.isArray(r.notes) ? r.notes : notes.list;\n}\n\n/* ---------- 锚点：选区 ⇄ 字符偏移 ---------- */\n/** 一页文本层的「拼接串 + 文本节点表」；at(off) 给 (文本节点, 节点内偏移)，offsetOf(node,off) 反向换算。\n *  必须用文本节点：Range.setStart(元素, n) 里的 n 是子节点序号（查找高亮踩过这个坑）。 */\nfunction noteTextHay(pageDiv) {\n  const tl = pageDiv && pageDiv.querySelector('.textLayer');\n  if (!tl) return null;\n  const nodes = [];\n  const startOf = [];\n  let hay = '';\n  const walker = document.createTreeWalker(tl, NodeFilter.SHOW_TEXT);\n  for (let n = walker.nextNode(); n; n = walker.nextNode()) {\n    const t = n.nodeValue || '';\n    if (!t) continue;\n    nodes.push(n);\n    startOf.push(hay.length);\n    hay += t;\n  }\n  if (!hay) return null;\n  const at = (off) => {\n    let lo = 0;\n    let hi = startOf.length - 1;\n    let idx = 0;\n    while (lo <= hi) {\n      const mid = (lo + hi) >> 1;\n      if (startOf[mid] <= off) { idx = mid; lo = mid + 1; } else { hi = mid - 1; }\n    }\n    const node = nodes[idx];\n    return [node, Math.max(0, Math.min(off - startOf[idx], node.nodeValue.length))];\n  };\n  const offsetOf = (node, off) => {\n    const i = nodes.indexOf(node);\n    return i < 0 ? null : startOf[i] + off;\n  };\n  return { hay, at, offsetOf, length: hay.length };\n}\n/** 把当前选区换算成 `{page,start,end,doc}`；换算不出来（扫描件/跨页/结构异常）返回 null */\nfunction noteAnchorFromSelection() {\n  const sel = askSelection;\n  if (!sel || !sel.range || !current) return null;\n  const node = sel.range.startContainer;\n  const el = node && (node.nodeType === 3 ? node.parentElement : node);\n  const pageEl = el && el.closest ? el.closest('.page') : null;\n  if (!pageEl) return null;\n  const page = +(pageEl.dataset.page || 0) || 0;\n  if (!page) return null;\n  const hay = noteTextHay(pageEl);\n  if (!hay) return null;\n  const start = hay.offsetOf(sel.range.startContainer, sel.range.startOffset);\n  const end = hay.offsetOf(sel.range.endContainer, sel.range.endOffset);\n  if (start === null || end === null) return null;\n  const a = Math.min(start, end);\n  const b = Math.max(start, end);\n  if (b - a < 1) return null;\n  // 分屏时在中文列划的词，锚点算的是译文文本层的偏移 → 记下是哪一列，重画时只画回同一列\n  const doc = pageEl.closest('#pdf-pages-zh') ? 'zh' : 'orig';\n  return { page, start: a, end: b, doc, quote: sel.text.slice(0, 400) };\n}\n\n/* ---------- 画波浪线（蓝色，选中文字下方） ---------- */\nfunction noteClearLayers() {\n  document.querySelectorAll('.noteLayer').forEach((l) => l.remove());\n  noteHideTip();\n}\nfunction notePaintPageDiv(div) {\n  const tl = div && div.querySelector('.textLayer');\n  const page = +(div && div.dataset && div.dataset.page) || 0;\n  if (!tl || !page) return;\n  const doc = div.closest && div.closest('#pdf-pages-zh') ? 'zh' : 'orig';\n  const list = notes.list.filter((n) => n.anchor && n.anchor.page === page\n    && n.anchor.end > n.anchor.start && (n.anchor.doc || 'orig') === doc);\n  if (!list.length) return;\n  const hay = noteTextHay(div);\n  const rect = tl.getBoundingClientRect();\n  if (!hay || !rect.width || !rect.height) return;\n  // 同一页可能被重画多次（逐页渲染 + 收尾重放）：先清掉这一页旧的装饰层，避免叠出两层波浪线\n  const stale = div.querySelector(':scope > .noteLayer');\n  if (stale) stale.remove();\n  const pct = (v, base) => (v / base * 100).toFixed(3) + '%';\n  const layer = document.createElement('div');\n  layer.className = 'noteLayer';\n  // 与 findLayer 同理：必须插在 textLayer **之前**，否则 paintPage 的 firstChild/lastChild 会取错元素\n  div.insertBefore(layer, tl);\n  for (const n of list) {\n    const a = Math.max(0, Math.min(n.anchor.start, hay.length - 1));\n    const b = Math.max(a + 1, Math.min(n.anchor.end, hay.length));\n    const [na, oa] = hay.at(a);\n    const [nb, ob] = hay.at(b);\n    try {\n      const rng = document.createRange();\n      rng.setStart(na, oa);\n      rng.setEnd(nb, ob);\n      for (const r of rng.getClientRects()) {\n        if (r.width < 0.6 || r.height < 0.6) continue;   // 换行点产生的退化矩形\n        const box = document.createElement('span');\n        box.className = 'note-under';\n        box.dataset.note = n.id;\n        box.style.left = pct(r.left - rect.left, rect.width);\n        box.style.top = pct(r.top - rect.top, rect.height);\n        box.style.width = pct(r.width, rect.width);\n        box.style.height = pct(r.height, rect.height);\n        layer.appendChild(box);\n      }\n    } catch { /* 单条锚点算不出几何：跳过这条，列表里仍能看到 */ }\n  }\n  if (!layer.childElementCount) layer.remove();\n}\n/** 缩放/切模式/换文档会重建整个 DOM：重画全部波浪线 */\nfunction notesReapply() {\n  noteClearLayers();\n  if (!pdfDoc || !notes.list.length) return;\n  document.querySelectorAll('#pdf-pages .page, #pdf-pages-zh .page').forEach((div) => notePaintPageDiv(div));\n}\n\n/* ---------- 悬停提示 + 点击命中 ---------- */\nfunction noteById(id) {\n  return notes.list.find((n) => n.id === id) || null;\n}\nfunction noteFindAt(x, y) {\n  for (const box of document.querySelectorAll('.note-under')) {\n    const r = box.getBoundingClientRect();\n    if (x >= r.left - 1 && x <= r.right + 1 && y >= r.top - 1 && y <= r.bottom + 2) return box.dataset.note || null;\n  }\n  return null;\n}\nfunction noteHideTip() {\n  if (noteTipEl) noteTipEl.style.display = 'none';\n}\nfunction noteShowTip(n, x, y) {\n  if (!n || !noteTipEl) { noteHideTip(); return; }\n  const body = String(n.body || '').trim();\n  noteTipEl.textContent = '';\n  const t = document.createElement('span');\n  t.textContent = body.length > 400 ? body.slice(0, 400) + '…' : body;\n  noteTipEl.appendChild(t);\n  const hint = document.createElement('span');\n  hint.className = 'tip-hint';\n  hint.textContent = '点击编辑这条笔记';\n  noteTipEl.appendChild(hint);\n  noteTipEl.style.display = 'block';\n  const r = noteTipEl.getBoundingClientRect();\n  noteTipEl.style.left = Math.max(8, Math.min(x + 12, window.innerWidth - r.width - 8)) + 'px';\n  noteTipEl.style.top = Math.max(8, Math.min(y + 16, window.innerHeight - r.height - 8)) + 'px';\n}\n$('main').addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n  if ((noteWinEl && noteWinEl.contains(e.target)) || (askPop && askPop.contains(e.target))) {\n    noteHideTip();\n    return;\n  }\n  if (noteHoverRaf) return;\n  const x = e.clientX;\n  const y = e.clientY;\n  noteHoverRaf = requestAnimationFrame(() => {\n    noteHoverRaf = 0;\n    const id = noteFindAt(x, y);\n    if (id === noteHoverId && id) { noteShowTip(noteById(id), x, y); return; }\n    noteHoverId = id;\n    if (id) noteShowTip(noteById(id), x, y);\n    else noteHideTip();\n  });\n});\n\n/* ---------- 笔记窗口：列表态 / 编辑态 ---------- */\nfunction noteWinShow(on) {\n  if (!noteWinEl) return;\n  if (!on) {\n    noteWinEl.classList.remove('on');\n    notes.shown = false;\n    noteHideTip();\n    return;\n  }\n  noteWinEl.classList.add('on');\n  notes.shown = true;\n  noteWinPlace();\n  renderNoteList();\n}\nfunction noteFmtTime(iso) {\n  const d = iso ? new Date(iso) : null;\n  if (!d || Number.isNaN(d.getTime())) return '';\n  const p = (v) => String(v).padStart(2, '0');\n  return `${d.getFullYear()}-${p(d.getMonth() + 1)}-${p(d.getDate())} ${p(d.getHours())}:${p(d.getMinutes())}`;\n}\nfunction renderNoteList() {\n  const list = $('note-list');\n  const head = $('note-headcount');\n  if (!list || !head) return;\n  head.textContent = notes.list.length ? `${notes.list.length} 条` : '';\n  list.textContent = '';\n  if (!notes.list.length) {\n    const empty = document.createElement('div');\n    empty.id = 'note-empty';\n    empty.textContent = notes.loading\n      ? '正在读取笔记…'\n      : '还没有笔记。选中正文里的文字 → 点「笔记」，或点标题栏的 ＋ 新建。笔记保存在这篇文献旁边（<论文>.notes.json），换浏览器也不会丢。';\n    list.appendChild(empty);\n    return;\n  }\n  // 按原文顺序列（没锚定的排最后）\n  const sorted = notes.list.slice().sort((a, b) => {\n    const pa = a.anchor && a.anchor.page ? a.anchor.page : 1e9;\n    const pb = b.anchor && b.anchor.page ? b.anchor.page : 1e9;\n    if (pa !== pb) return pa - pb;\n    return ((a.anchor && a.anchor.start) || 0) - ((b.anchor && b.anchor.start) || 0);\n  });\n  const frag = document.createDocumentFragment();\n  for (const n of sorted) {\n    const btn = document.createElement('button');\n    btn.type = 'button';\n    btn.className = 'note-item';\n    btn.dataset.id = n.id;\n    btn.title = n.anchor && n.anchor.page ? `跳到第 ${n.anchor.page} 页` : '这条笔记没有可定位的原文位置';\n    const meta = document.createElement('span');\n    meta.className = 'ni-meta';\n    meta.textContent = n.anchor && n.anchor.page ? `第 ${n.anchor.page} 页` : '未定位';\n    const time = document.createElement('span');\n    time.className = 'ni-time';\n    time.textContent = noteFmtTime(n.updated || n.created);\n    meta.appendChild(time);\n    const bodyEl = document.createElement('span');\n    bodyEl.className = 'ni-body';\n    const body = String(n.body || '').trim();\n    bodyEl.textContent = body.length > 220 ? body.slice(0, 220) + '…' : body;\n    btn.appendChild(meta);\n    btn.appendChild(bodyEl);\n    if (n.quote) {\n      const q = document.createElement('span');\n      q.className = 'ni-quote';\n      q.textContent = '「' + String(n.quote).replace(/\\s+/g, ' ') + '」';\n      btn.appendChild(q);\n    }\n    frag.appendChild(btn);\n  }\n  list.appendChild(frag);\n}\nfunction noteSetEditing(on) {\n  notes.armed = false;\n  const del = $('note-delete');\n  if (del) { del.textContent = '删除'; del.classList.remove('primary'); }\n  noteWinEl.classList.toggle('editing', !!on);\n  if (!on) { notes.editing = null; notes.isNew = true; }\n}\nfunction noteStartEdit(note) {\n  const isNew = !notes.list.some((n) => n.id === note.id);\n  notes.editing = note;\n  notes.isNew = isNew;\n  $('note-quote').textContent = note.quote ? '「' + String(note.quote).replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').slice(0, 300) + '」' : '（没有引用原文，只留正文）';\n  $('note-body').value = note.body || '';\n  $('note-delete').style.display = isNew ? 'none' : '';\n  noteWinEl.classList.add('editing');\n  noteWinShow(true);\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    const t = $('note-body');\n    if (t) { t.focus(); t.setSelectionRange(t.value.length, t.value.length); }\n  }, 30);\n}\n/** 划词「笔记」：带着引文和锚点直接进编辑态（保存前不落盘） */\nfunction noteCreateFromSelection() {\n  const sel = askSelection;\n  if (!sel || !current) { toast('先在正文里选中一段文字'); return; }\n  const anchor = noteAnchorFromSelection();\n  noteStartEdit({ quote: sel.text, anchor: anchor || undefined, body: '' });\n  if (!anchor) toast('这段选区没能精确锚定：笔记会留在列表里，但不会画波浪线', 5000);\n}\nfunction noteCreateBlank() {\n  const sel = askSelection;\n  if (sel && sel.text) { noteCreateFromSelection(); return; }\n  noteStartEdit({ quote: '', body: '' });\n}\nasync function noteSave() {\n  const body = $('note-body').value.trim();\n  if (!body) { toast('笔记内容不能为空'); return; }\n  if (!current) return;\n  const old = notes.editing || {};\n  const note = {\n    id: old.id,\n    quote: old.quote || '',\n    anchor: old.anchor || undefined,\n    body: body.slice(0, NOTE_BODY_MAX),\n    created: old.created,\n    updated: old.updated,\n  };\n  $('note-save').disabled = true;\n  try {\n    await notesPost('save', note);\n    noteSetEditing(false);\n    renderNoteList();\n    notesReapply();\n    toast('笔记已保存');\n  } catch (e) { toast('保存失败：' + e.message, 6000); }\n  $('note-save').disabled = false;\n}\nfunction noteArmDelete() {\n  const btn = $('note-delete');\n  if (!notes.editing || notes.isNew) return;\n  if (!notes.armed) {\n    notes.armed = true;\n    btn.classList.add('primary');\n    btn.textContent = '确认删除';\n    btn.title = '再点一次确认删除这条笔记';\n    clearTimeout(noteArmTimer);\n    noteArmTimer = setTimeout(() => {\n      notes.armed = false;\n      btn.textContent = '删除';\n      btn.classList.remove('primary');\n      btn.title = '删除这条笔记';\n    }, 3000);\n    return;\n  }\n  clearTimeout(noteArmTimer);\n  notes.armed = false;\n  btn.textContent = '删除';\n  btn.classList.remove('primary');\n  void noteDoDelete(notes.editing);\n}\nasync function noteDoDelete(note) {\n  if (!note || !note.id) return;\n  try {\n    await notesPost('delete', note);\n    noteSetEditing(false);\n    renderNoteList();\n    notesReapply();\n    toast('笔记已删除');\n  } catch (e) { toast('删除失败：' + e.message, 6000); }\n}\nasync function noteGoto(note) {\n  if (!note) return;\n  const a = note.anchor;\n  if (!a || !a.page) { toast('这条笔记没有可定位的原文位置'); return; }\n  await findReadyPage(a.page);\n  notesReapply();\n  // 不把 id 拼进 CSS 选择器：服务端只截长度、不限字符集，id 含引号/括号会抛 DOMException。\n  let box = null;\n  for (const b of document.querySelectorAll('.note-under')) {\n    if (b.dataset.note === note.id) { box = b; break; }\n  }\n  const target = box || origPageNode(a.page);\n  if (target) target.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'center' });\n  if (box) {\n    box.classList.add('flash');\n    setTimeout(() => box.classList.remove('flash'), 900);\n  }\n}\n\n/* ---------- 气泡里的附加动作：笔记 / 全局搜索 ---------- */\n/** 「全局搜索」= 把选中文字塞进查找窗口并跳到第一处（与手打关键词同一条链路，不另做一套搜索） */\nfunction findSearchText(text) {\n  const q = String(text || '').replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').trim();\n  if (!q) { toast('没有可搜索的文字'); return; }\n  const use = q.length > 120 ? q.slice(0, 120) : q;\n  findInputEl.value = use;\n  findWinShow(true);\n  void findRun(use).then(() => findGoto(0)).catch(() => { /* 索引失败：列表里会有说明 */ });\n}\n$('ask-find').onclick = () => {\n  askPop.style.display = 'none';\n  if (askSelection) findSearchText(askSelection.text);\n};\n$('ask-note').onclick = () => {\n  askPop.style.display = 'none';\n  noteCreateFromSelection();\n};\n\n/* ---------- 接线 ---------- */\n$('note-open').onclick = () => {\n  if (!current) return;\n  if (noteWinEl.classList.contains('on') && !noteWinEl.classList.contains('editing')) { noteWinShow(false); return; }\n  noteSetEditing(false);\n  noteWinShow(true);\n};\n$('note-window-close').onclick = () => { noteSetEditing(false); noteWinShow(false); };\n$('note-new').onclick = () => noteCreateBlank();\n$('note-save').onclick = () => void noteSave();\n$('note-cancel').onclick = () => noteSetEditing(false);\n$('note-delete').onclick = () => noteArmDelete();\n$('note-list').addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n  const btn = e.target.closest ? e.target.closest('.note-item') : null;\n  if (!btn) return;\n  void noteGoto(noteById(btn.dataset.id));\n});\n$('note-body').addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n  if ((e.metaKey || e.ctrlKey) && e.key === 'Enter') { e.preventDefault(); void noteSave(); }\n  else if (e.key === 'Escape') { e.preventDefault(); noteSetEditing(false); }\n});\n// 全局 Esc：标题栏写着「关闭（Esc）」就必须真的能关。编辑态里先退出编辑（上面的 textarea\n// 处理器已 preventDefault，这里靠 defaultPrevented 避免同一次按键把窗口也一起关掉）。\ndocument.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n  if (e.key !== 'Escape' || e.defaultPrevented) return;\n  if (!noteWinEl || !noteWinEl.classList.contains('on')) return;\n  if (noteWinEl.classList.contains('editing')) noteSetEditing(false);\n  else noteWinShow(false);\n});\n$('note-head').addEventListener('pointerdown', noteWinDrag);\n$('note-grip').addEventListener('pointerdown', (e) => noteWinResize(e, 'se'));\n$('note-grip-r').addEventListener('pointerdown', (e) => noteWinResize(e, 'e'));\n$('note-grip-b').addEventListener('pointerdown', (e) => noteWinResize(e, 's'));\nwindow.addEventListener('resize', () => { if (noteWinEl.classList.contains('on')) noteWinPlace(); });\n$('pdf-pane').addEventListener('scroll', () => { noteHideTip(); }, { passive: true });\nnoteWinLoad();\n\n/** 排查用：控制台执行 dprNotesDebug() 看笔记状态（波浪线不显示时先看 boxes） */\nwindow.dprNotesDebug = () => ({\n  paper: current ? current.topic + '/' + current.name : null,\n  notes: notes.list.length,\n  anchored: notes.list.filter((n) => n.anchor).length,\n  boxes: document.querySelectorAll('.note-under').length,\n  layers: document.querySelectorAll('.noteLayer').length,\n  editing: notes.editing ? notes.editing.id || '(new)' : null,\n  windowOpen: !!(noteWinEl && noteWinEl.classList.contains('on')),\n});\n\n/* ================= 中英切换 ================= */\n/** 翻译进度条（只在 busy 时出现）：宽度跟着后端 progress.overall，文字给阶段+百分比。 */\nfunction updateZhProgress() {  const box = $('zh-prog');\n  const busy = Boolean(zhState && zhState.busy);\n  const p = busy ? zhState.progress : null;\n  $('zh-cancel').style.display = busy ? '' : 'none';\n  if (!busy) { zhCancelArmed = false; $('zh-cancel').textContent = '取消'; }\n  if (!p) { box.hidden = true; return; }\n  const pct = typeof p.overall === 'number' ? Math.max(0, Math.min(100, p.overall)) : null;\n  box.hidden = false;\n  box.querySelector('.fill').style.width = (pct === null ? 8 : Math.max(2, pct)).toFixed(1) + '%';\n  box.querySelector('.txt').textContent = pct === null\n    ? `${p.label || '翻译'}…`\n    : `${p.label || '翻译'} ${Math.round(pct)}%`;\n  box.title = p.text || '';\n}\nlet zhCancelArmed = false;\n$('zh-cancel').onclick = async () => {\n  if (!zhState.busy) return;\n  if (!zhCancelArmed) {\n    zhCancelArmed = true;\n    $('zh-cancel').textContent = '确认取消?';\n    setTimeout(() => { if (zhCancelArmed) { zhCancelArmed = false; $('zh-cancel').textContent = '取消'; } }, 3000);\n    return;\n  }\n  zhCancelArmed = false;\n  $('zh-cancel').disabled = true;\n  try {\n    await api('/zh/cancel', {\n      method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify(current),\n    });\n    toast('已取消翻译，可以换端点重试');\n  } catch (e) { toast('取消失败：' + e.message, 8000); }\n  finally {\n    $('zh-cancel').disabled = false;\n    $('zh-cancel').textContent = '取消';\n    await refreshZhState();\n  }\n};\n// 别人启动的翻译（另开会话/刷新页面后进来）也要能看到进度：busy 就自动挂一个低成本轮询\nlet zhWatch = null;\nlet zhGenerating = false;\nfunction ensureZhWatch() {\n  if (zhState.busy && !zhWatch && !zhGenerating) {\n    zhWatch = setInterval(() => { void refreshZhState(); }, 1200);\n  } else if (!zhState.busy && zhWatch) {\n    clearInterval(zhWatch); zhWatch = null;\n  }\n}\nasync function refreshZhState() {\n  const prev = zhState;\n  zhState = await api(`/zh?topic=${encodeURIComponent(current.topic)}&name=${encodeURIComponent(current.name)}`);\n  // 译文生成完成/被删除/新增：旧文档与已画节点全部失效（重新翻译后文件内容变了）。\n  if (!openingPaper && (prev.busy !== zhState.busy || prev.zh !== zhState.zh || prev.dual !== zhState.dual)) {\n    await invalidateAltViews();\n  }\n  const btn = $('zh-toggle');\n  btn.style.display = '';\n  btn.disabled = zhState.busy;\n  btn.innerHTML = iconHtml(zhState.busy ? 'spin' : 'translate'); // busy：旋转弧图标（原「译」字）\n  btn.title = zhState.busy ? (zhState.phase || `翻译进行中${zhState.model ? `（${zhState.model}）` : ''}…`)\n    : (zhState.zh || zhState.dual) ? '切换中文译文'\n    : '还没有中文版，点击生成（babeldoc，需要几分钟）';\n  // 安装/准备阶段在状态栏持续可见（轮询每 5s 刷新一次）；翻译结束后恢复论文基线信息\n  const statusEl = $('status');\n  if (zhState.busy && zhState.phase) {\n    statusEl.textContent = zhState.phase;\n    statusEl.dataset.phaseShown = '1';\n  } else if (zhState.error && zhState.error !== '已取消翻译') {\n    // 失败原因持续留在顶栏（完整文本放 title），刷新/后台任务也能看到，不靠一次性 toast。\n    statusEl.textContent = '翻译失败：' + zhState.error;\n    statusEl.title = zhState.error;\n    statusEl.dataset.errorShown = '1';\n    if (prev.error !== zhState.error) toast('生成失败：' + zhState.error, 12000);\n  } else if (!zhState.busy && (statusEl.dataset.phaseShown || statusEl.dataset.errorShown)) {\n    delete statusEl.dataset.phaseShown;\n    delete statusEl.dataset.errorShown;\n    if (statusMeta) statusEl.textContent = statusMeta;\n    statusEl.title = $('pdf-path').textContent ? `${$('pdf-path').textContent}（点击复制）` : '';\n  }\n  updateZhProgress();\n  ensureZhWatch();\n  // 重翻按钮只在「已有译文且空闲」时出现；状态变化时顺手拆掉两击确认的待确认态\n  const regen = $('zh-regen');\n  const canRegen = (zhState.zh || zhState.dual) && !zhState.busy;\n  regen.style.display = canRegen ? '' : 'none';\n  if (!canRegen) disarmRegen();\n  // 分屏激活中 -zh.pdf 没了（重翻/外部删除）→ 自动回落原文 + toast + 把持久化写回 ''（§4.2/B8）\n  if (viewMode === 'split' && !zhState.zh) {\n    toast('中文版不存在，已退回原文', 4000);\n    await setViewMode('orig');\n    return;\n  }\n  // 单文档视图：-zh/-dual 被删/重翻后对应文件暂时不存在 → 如实回落原文\n  if (!openingPaper && viewMode === 'zh' && !zhState.zh) {\n    toast('中文版不存在，已退回原文', 4000);\n    await setViewMode('orig');\n    return;\n  }\n  if (!openingPaper && viewMode === 'dual' && !zhState.dual) {\n    toast('中英对照版不存在，已退回原文', 4000);\n    await setViewMode('orig');\n    return;\n  }\n  // 重翻期间可能已回落到原文（invalidateAltViews）；生成完成后把当前视图接回来\n  if (!openingPaper && (viewMode === 'zh' || viewMode === 'dual') && activeKey !== viewMode &&\n      ((viewMode === 'zh' && zhState.zh) || (viewMode === 'dual' && zhState.dual))) {\n    try { await activateView(viewMode); } catch { /* 新译文损坏：保持原文 */ }\n  }\n  updateViewButtons();\n}\n\n/** 顶栏三个视图控件的状态机（§4.3）：文案/active/disabled/title 全在这一处决定。 */\nfunction updateViewButtons() {\n  const zt = $('zh-toggle'), dt = $('dual-toggle'), st = $('split-toggle');\n  const hasZh = zhState.zh, hasDual = zhState.dual, hasAny = hasZh || hasDual;\n  const splitOn = viewMode === 'split';\n  // 「中」的语义**不变**：原文 ↔ (有 zh ? 'zh' : 'dual')；分屏时加闸（避免在 zhVariant===null\n  // 的误解下误开生成流程），其余情况与改造前逐字一致。\n  zt.disabled = splitOn || zhState.busy;\n  zt.title = splitOn ? '分屏对照中：先关闭分屏'\n    : zhState.busy ? (zhState.phase || `翻译进行中${zhState.model ? `（${zhState.model}）` : ''}…`)\n    : hasAny ? '切换中文译文'\n    : '还没有中文版，点击生成（babeldoc，需要几分钟）';\n  zt.classList.toggle('active', zhVariant !== null);\n\n  dt.style.display = '';   // D1（队长裁定）：按钮恒可见，无产物时 disabled + title 说明原因，\n                           // 把死控件变成解释（与 §6 B1 字面一致，也与 zhonly/dualonly 两态一致）\n  dt.classList.toggle('active', viewMode === 'dual');\n  dt.disabled = zhState.busy || !hasDual;\n  dt.title = zhState.busy ? (zhState.phase || '翻译进行中…')\n    : !hasDual ? '还没有中英对照版，先用「中」生成（babeldoc，需要几分钟）'\n    : viewMode === 'dual' ? '当前：中英对照（模式 A），点击回到原文'\n    : '用 babeldoc 的中英对照 PDF（模式 A）';\n\n  st.style.display = '';   // D1：同上\n  st.classList.toggle('active', splitOn);\n  st.disabled = zhState.busy || !hasZh;\n  st.title = zhState.busy ? (zhState.phase || '翻译进行中…')\n    : !hasZh ? (hasDual ? '需先生成中文版（模式 B 用 -zh.pdf 与原文并排）' : '还没有中文版，先用「中」生成（babeldoc，需要几分钟）')\n    : splitOn ? '当前：分屏对照（模式 B），点击回到原文'\n    : '原文与中文版并排同步滚动（模式 B）';\n\n  // 「同步滚动」开关：与三个视图控件同一个状态机（一处决定所有按钮的可见性/文案/态）；\n  // 仅分屏下可见 —— 模式 A/原文/译文只有一个滚动条，开关无意义\n  updateSyncToggle();\n  try { syncViewMenu(); } catch { /* 初始化次序未到（菜单函数在脚本更后方，事件驱动后即正常） */ }\n}\n\n$('zh-toggle').onclick = async () => {\n  if (!current || zhState.busy || viewMode === 'split') return;\n  if (zhState.dual || zhState.zh) {\n    // 两态切换：原文 ↔ 纯中文；只存在对照版时退到对照（既有语义一字不动）\n    await setViewMode(zhVariant === null ? (zhState.zh ? 'zh' : 'dual') : 'orig');\n    return;\n  }\n  await openGeneratePop(false);\n};\n\n/* ================= 视图模式（模式 A 对照 / 模式 B 分屏）=================\n   三个控件共用 viewMode；进入任一非 orig 模式都先退出另一个（互斥）。 */\n\n/** 持久化复用既有键：lib/client.js 的改名搬家只搬 `dpr.variant.` 前缀，新增键不会被迁移（C19）。 */\nfunction persistViewMode() {\n  localStorage.setItem(variantKey(current.topic, current.name), viewMode === 'orig' ? '' : viewMode);\n}\n\n/** 读回持久化的视图模式（§4.3 的取值表）：译文/分屏不存在时回落原文，非空不可用的值由调用方回写空。 */\nfunction viewModeFromSaved(saved, st) {\n  if (saved === 'zh' && st.zh) return 'zh';\n  if (saved === 'dual' && st.dual) return 'dual';\n  if (saved === 'split' && st.zh) return 'split';   // 分屏需要 -zh.pdf\n  return 'orig';\n}\n\n/** 视图模式的状态机（守卫 → 赋值 → 持久化 → 三个按钮/下载按钮/公式面板）。\n *  返回 false = 守卫拦下（状态未变）。渲染留给 setViewMode，便于单测状态机（B11/B12/R4）。 */\nfunction applyViewMode(mode) {\n  if (!current) return false;\n  if (mode === 'dual' && !zhState.dual) return false;   // 没有 -dual.pdf，不进（按钮已 disabled）\n  if (mode === 'split' && !zhState.zh) return false;    // 没有 -zh.pdf，不进\n  if (mode === 'split' && window.innerWidth < SPLIT_MIN_WIDTH) {\n    toast('面板太窄，请把阅读器拉宽后再用分屏对照', 4000);\n    return false;\n  }\n  viewMode = mode;\n  zhVariant = mode === 'zh' ? 'zh' : mode === 'dual' ? 'dual' : null; // split → null（C17）\n  persistViewMode();\n  // 切换变体后强制适宽：译文版页宽与原文不同（对照双栏≈2×、分屏每列半宽），不重算会溢出裁切\n  fitMode = true; fitBtn.classList.add('active');\n  updateViewButtons();\n  updateDlBtn();\n  renderEqPanel(); // 译文视图要给出「没有位置信息」的说明（热区同时被 eqHotEnabled 关掉）\n  return true;\n}\n\nasync function setViewMode(mode) {\n  if (!applyViewMode(mode)) return;\n  if (mode === 'split') { await openSplit(); return; }\n  teardownSplit();\n  const key = zhVariant || 'orig';\n  let ok = false;\n  try { ok = await activateView(key); } catch { ok = false; }\n  if (!ok) {\n    // 目标译文不存在/损坏：如实回退原文，不留下“按钮亮着但内容没换”的状态\n    await applyViewMode('orig');\n    await activateView('orig');\n    toast('打开译文失败，已退回原文', 5000);\n    return;\n  }\n  schedulePreload();\n}\n$('dual-toggle').onclick = () => setViewMode(viewMode === 'dual' ? 'orig' : 'dual');\n$('split-toggle').onclick = () => setViewMode(viewMode === 'split' ? 'orig' : 'split');\n\nlet generateForce = false;\nlet generateEndpoints = [];\nfunction endpointDisplay(e) {\n  const provider = providerOf(e.baseUrl).name;\n  return `${e.label || provider} · ${e.model || '未填模型'} · ${e.apiKeyHint || '无 Key'}`;\n}\nfunction closeGeneratePop() { $('generate-pop').style.display = 'none'; }\nasync function openGeneratePop(force) {\n  generateForce = force;\n  let cfg;\n  try { cfg = await api('/translate/config'); }\n  catch (e) { toast('读取翻译端点失败：' + e.message, 8000); return; }\n  generateEndpoints = (cfg.endpoints || []).filter((e) => e.complete);\n  if (!generateEndpoints.length) {\n    cfgRetryForce = force;\n    await openCfgPop(true);\n    return;\n  }\n  const sel = $('generate-endpoint');\n  sel.innerHTML = '';\n  for (const e of generateEndpoints) {\n    const opt = document.createElement('option');\n    opt.value = e.id; opt.textContent = endpointDisplay(e);\n    sel.appendChild(opt);\n  }\n  sel.value = generateEndpoints.some((e) => e.id === cfg.activeId) ? cfg.activeId : generateEndpoints[0].id;\n  const pop = $('generate-pop');\n  pop.style.display = 'block';\n  pop.style.left = Math.max(8, (window.innerWidth - pop.offsetWidth) / 2) + 'px';\n  pop.style.top = Math.max(8, (window.innerHeight - pop.offsetHeight) / 3) + 'px';\n}\n$('generate-start').onclick = () => {\n  const id = $('generate-endpoint').value;\n  closeGeneratePop();\n  void startGenerate(generateForce, id);\n};\n$('generate-cancel').onclick = closeGeneratePop;\n$('generate-manage').onclick = () => {\n  closeGeneratePop();\n  cfgRetryForce = generateForce;\n  void openCfgPop(true);\n};\n\n// 生成/重翻共用：force=true 时服务端先删旧译文再启动；成功后轮询到完成\nasync function startGenerate(force, endpointId) {\n  try {\n    const r = await api('/zh/generate', {\n      method: 'POST', headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' },\n      body: JSON.stringify({ ...current, ...(force ? { force: true } : {}), ...(endpointId ? { endpointId } : {}) }),\n    });\n    const m = zhState.model ? `（${zhState.model}）` : '';\n    toast(r.firstRun\n      ? '首次使用：正在自动安装翻译引擎（uv + Python + babeldoc，约几分钟），装完自动开始翻译…'\n      : (force ? `已删除旧译文，开始重新翻译${m}…` : `开始生成中文版${m}（约几分钟）…`), 6000);\n  } catch (e) {\n    // 没配端点 → 直接弹配置表单；填好保存后自动回来重试（记住是不是重翻）\n    if (e.code === 'no-endpoint') { cfgRetryForce = force; openCfgPop(true); return; }\n    if (e.code === 'endpoint-not-found') { toast(e.message, 6000); await openGeneratePop(force); return; }\n    toast(e.message, 8000); return;\n  }\n  $('zh-toggle').disabled = true; $('zh-toggle').innerHTML = iconHtml('spin');\n  $('zh-regen').style.display = 'none';\n  // 先本地亮一个「准备中」的进度条，别等第一轮轮询才出现（首轮可能要几秒）\n  zhState = { ...zhState, busy: true, progress: null };\n  updateZhProgress();\n  zhGenerating = true;\n  // 翻译期间 1s 一轮（进度条要跟手）；结束后自动停\n  const timer = setInterval(async () => {\n    await refreshZhState();\n    if (!zhState.busy) {\n      clearInterval(timer);\n      zhGenerating = false;\n      ensureZhWatch();\n      if (zhState.dual || zhState.zh) {\n        toast('中文版已生成');\n        // 重翻完成时用户可能正停在译文视图/分屏：原地刷新，而不是来回切换\n        if (viewMode === 'split') await openSplit(); // 分屏：重翻后重新拉 -zh.pdf（旧文档已失效）\n        else if (zhVariant) await activateView(zhVariant); // 单文档：缓存已被 refreshZhState 失效，重新加载新译文\n        else $('zh-toggle').click();\n      }\n      else if (!zhState.error) toast('生成失败：未知原因', 8000); // 具体错误已由 refreshZhState 持续展示并提示\n    }\n  }, 1000);\n}\n\n/* ================= 重新翻译（重翻按钮，两击确认） ================= */\n// 不用原生 confirm：阅读器跑在 dsh 桌面壳的 iframe 里，原生对话框行为不可靠。\n// 第一击把按钮变成「重翻?」待确认态（3 秒有效），第二击才真删真跑。\nlet regenArmTimer = null;\nfunction disarmRegen() {\n  clearTimeout(regenArmTimer); regenArmTimer = null;\n  const btn = $('zh-regen');\n  btn.innerHTML = iconHtml('regen'); btn.classList.remove('active');\n}\n$('zh-regen').onclick = async () => {\n  if (!current || zhState.busy) return;\n  const btn = $('zh-regen');\n  if (regenArmTimer) {           // 第二击：确认执行\n    disarmRegen();\n    await openGeneratePop(true);\n    return;\n  }\n  btn.textContent = '重翻?';      // 第一击：进入待确认态\n  btn.classList.add('active');\n  regenArmTimer = setTimeout(disarmRegen, 3000);\n};\n\n/* ================= 翻译端点设置 ================= */\n// 供应商预设（OpenAI 兼容端点，对齐 lflow 的供应商清单）：选中即回填 URL + 推荐模型。\n// 一律走 Coding 套餐端点——买套餐是常态；套餐 key 走按量口会报余额不足。按量用户选「自定义」手填。\n// models 仅作 datalist 建议，输入框仍可自由填写（新型号上线不用发版）。\n// glm-5.x / k3 / deepseek-flash 是推理型，服务端会对这三家域名自动关 thinking（translate.ts）。\nconst PROVIDERS = [\n  { id: 'custom',   name: '自定义（OpenAI 兼容）', baseUrl: '', models: [] },\n  { id: 'deepseek', name: 'DeepSeek',  baseUrl: 'https://api.deepseek.com',                     models: ['deepseek-v4-pro', 'deepseek-flash'] },\n  { id: 'glm',      name: '智谱 GLM',   baseUrl: 'https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/coding/paas/v4', models: ['glm-5.3-flash', 'glm-5.3', 'glm-4.6'] },\n  { id: 'kimi',     name: 'Kimi',      baseUrl: 'https://api.kimi.com/coding/v1',              models: ['k3'] },\n  // OpenCode Go：订阅后到 OpenCode Console 复制 API Key；模型列表以控制台为准（此处只做输入建议）。\n  // 服务端会对 opencode.ai 的请求自带 x-opencode-session（见 src/opencode.ts）。\n  { id: 'opencode', name: 'OpenCode Go', baseUrl: 'https://opencode.ai/inference/go/openai/v1', models: ['deepseek-v4.1-flash', 'glm-5.3-flash', 'kimi-k3.1-pro', 'qwen3.8-flash', 'minimax-m3.1-flash'] },\n];\nconst normUrl = (u) => (u || '').trim().replace(/\\/+$/, '');\n// 按 baseUrl 反查预设（打开表单时回显选中项）；查不到就是 custom\nconst providerOf = (baseUrl) => PROVIDERS.find((p) => p.id !== 'custom' && normUrl(p.baseUrl) === normUrl(baseUrl)) || PROVIDERS[0];\n\n(function initProviderSelect() {\n  const sel = $('cfg-provider');\n  for (const p of PROVIDERS) {\n    const opt = document.createElement('option');\n    opt.value = p.id; opt.textContent = p.name;\n    sel.appendChild(opt);\n  }\n  sel.onchange = () => {\n    const p = PROVIDERS.find((x) => x.id === sel.value) || PROVIDERS[0];\n    if (p.baseUrl) $('cfg-url').value = p.baseUrl;   // custom 不动用户已填的 URL\n    $('cfg-model-list').innerHTML = p.models.map((m) => `<option value=\"${esc(m)}\">`).join('');\n    if (p.models.length && !p.models.includes($('cfg-model').value.trim())) $('cfg-model').value = p.models[0];\n  };\n})();\n\n// 保存成功后是否自动接着生成：点「中译」/「重翻」发现没配 → 弹本表单 → 填完直接开跑\nlet cfgRetryGenerate = false;\nlet cfgRetryForce = false;   // 待重试的是不是「重翻」（regen 图标进来时旧译文还在，zh-toggle 点击语义不对，必须带 force）\nlet cfgRetryTranslate = false; // 待重试的是不是「划词翻译」（点「译」发现没配端点 → 填完自动重试这次翻译）\nlet cfgEndpoints = [];\nlet cfgEditingId = 'new';\nlet cfgDeleteArmed = false;\n\nfunction fillCfgEndpoint(e) {\n  cfgEditingId = e?.id || 'new';\n  cfgDeleteArmed = false;\n  $('cfg-delete').textContent = '删除当前';\n  $('cfg-delete').disabled = !e || e.source === 'profile';\n  $('cfg-url').value = e?.baseUrl || '';\n  $('cfg-model').value = e?.model || '';\n  const sel = $('cfg-provider');\n  sel.value = providerOf(e?.baseUrl).id;\n  const keepUrl = $('cfg-url').value, keepModel = $('cfg-model').value;\n  sel.onchange();\n  $('cfg-url').value = keepUrl || $('cfg-url').value;\n  $('cfg-model').value = keepModel || $('cfg-model').value;\n  $('cfg-key').value = '';\n  $('cfg-key').placeholder = e?.hasApiKey ? `已保存（${e.apiKeyHint}），留空则不修改` : 'sk-...';\n  $('cfg-source').textContent = e\n    ? `${e.source === 'profile' ? 'profile 默认配置（保存会另存为本界面配置）' : '本界面保存的配置'}（key ${e.apiKeyHint || '未填'}）`\n    : '新端点：保存前会先做连接测试';\n}\nfunction fillCfgList(activeId) {\n  const sel = $('cfg-saved');\n  sel.innerHTML = '';\n  for (const e of cfgEndpoints) {\n    const opt = document.createElement('option');\n    opt.value = e.id; opt.textContent = endpointDisplay(e) + (e.complete ? '' : '（不完整）');\n    sel.appendChild(opt);\n  }\n  const add = document.createElement('option');\n  add.value = 'new'; add.textContent = '＋ 新建端点…';\n  sel.appendChild(add);\n  const selected = cfgEndpoints.find((e) => e.id === activeId) || null;\n  sel.value = selected?.id || 'new';\n  fillCfgEndpoint(selected);\n}\n$('cfg